        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Zara Bate, Harold Holt\n- Roles: Fashion designer, socialite, politician, Prime Minister of Australia\n- Places: Australia\n\nFacts:\n- Zara Bate was born on 10 March 1909 and died on 14 June 1989.\n- Harold Holt was born on 5 August 1908 and died on 17 December 1967.\n- Zara Bate, née Dickins and previously Fell and Holt, was an Australian fashion designer and socialite.\n- Harold Holt was an Australian politician.\n- Harold Holt was the 17th Prime Minister of Australia from 1966 to 1967.\n- Zara Bate was best known as the wife of Harold Holt, the 17th Prime Minister of Australia.",
